[39.703, "e\u001b[37Gan v1, because the weights\u001b[64Gare\u001b[68Gtransposed\u001b[79Gonce\u001b[84Gat\u001b[87Gstartup.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mLong contexts:\u001b[22m at\u001b[23Gention\u001b[30Gis still about 2.5\u00d7 slow\u001b[55Gr than memory speed allows.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mTu\u001b[8Ging \u001b[13Goise:\u001b[22m block s\u001b[27Gzes were tuned on\u001b[45Gthis\u001b[50GM1, where benchmark\u001b[70G vary by about\u001b[85G\u00b110%\u001b[90Gbetween\u001b[98Gruns.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mest coverage:\u001b[22m I only t\u001b[30Gted agai\u001b[39Gst\u001b[42Gthe public fixtures, not the\u001b[71Gfinal gate's inputs.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BEverything\u001b[14Gis\u001b[17Gin\u001b[20GNOTES.md:\u001b[30Gthe\u001b[34Gprofiling\u001b[44Gevidence,\u001b[54Gchanges,\u001b[63Gtests\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Glimitations.\u001b[86GThe\u001b[90Gprofiling\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gbenchmark\u001b[114Gscripts\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bar\u001b[6G in \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mprof/\u001b[39m.\u001b[17GBuilding with \u001b[38;2;87;105;247m-DPROF\u001b[39m pr\u001b[42Gts a p\u001b[49Gr-sectio\u001b[58G timing bre\u001b[70Gk\u001b[72Gown when the program receives QUIT.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u273b\u001b[3GBaked for 17m 26s \u00b7 done 9:08 AM\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mProfile this impl"]
[39.704, "ementation on the supplied development workloads. Improve performance within the same rules and \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mrema\u001b[8Gning budget. Preserve the\u001b[34Ginterface and correctness requirements. Do not use hidden evaluation inputs, external \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bimpleme\u001b[11Gtations or oth\u001b[27G ports. Record profiling \u001b[53Gvid\u001b[57Gnce, changes, tests\u001b[77Gand\u001b[81Gremaining limitations\u001b[105G NOTES.md.\u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\u273d\u001b[3GConcocting\u001b[38;2;245;149;117m\u2026\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m(35s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[24G3.1k tokens \u00b7 thought for 34s)\r\u001b[1B  \u23bf \u00a0Tip: Use /btw\u001b[20Gto ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H"]
