[142.446, "\u001b[H\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mremaining budget. Preserve the interface and correctness requirements. Do not use hidden evaluation inputs, external \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mimplementations or other ports. Record profiling evidence, changes, tests and remaining limitations in NOTES.md.\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mStarting\u001b[12Ground\u001b[18G3\u001b[20Gby\u001b[23Gre-profiling\u001b[36Gthe\u001b[40Gcurrent\u001b[48Gbuild\u001b[54Gon\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gfixture\u001b[69Gworkloads\u001b[79Gto\u001b[82Gsee\u001b[86Gwhere\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Gtime\u001b[101Ggoes\u001b[106Gnow.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gmachine is running slower today, about 50\u201354 GB/s\u001b[57Gagainst\u001b[65G57\u201360\u001b[71Gearlier.\u001b[80GI'm\u001b[84Gre-measuring\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gpure-read\u001b[111Gceiling\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band\u001b[7Gthe\u001b[11Gper-call\u001b[20Goverhead\u001b[29Gof\u001b[32G\u001b[38;2;87;105;247msgemv\u001b[38G\u001b[39mto\u001b[41Gget\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gcurrent\u001b[57Ggap.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m"]
[142.446, "\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe microbenchmark hits 58 GB/s and 0.57 \u00b5s per call, but the\u001b[65Gprogram only reaches about 51 GB/s, with the gap growing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Balongside matrix \u001b[21Giz\u001b[24G. Next I'll\u001b[36Gtime\u001b[41Ga\u001b[43Gmatmul-only\u001b[55Gpass\u001b[60Gover\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gprogram's\u001b[79Gown\u001b[83Gweights\u001b[91Gto\u001b[94Gsee\u001b[98Gwhich\u001b[104Gof\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111Gtwo\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpossible\u001b[12Gcauses\u001b[19Gis\u001b[22Gresponsible.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe probe\u001b[14Geadings a\u001b[24Ge \u001b[27Goisy, but the best repeat hits 60.5 GB/s, so the d\u001b[78Gcode is\u001b[86Gal\u001b[91Gdy near the \u001b[104Gardwa\u001b[110Ge limit.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAttention\u001b[13Gruns slower in the program than in\u001b[52Gmi\u001b[55Grobenchmark because th\u001b[78G weight\u001b[86Gstream\u001b[93Gevicts\u001b[100Geach\u001b[105Glayer's\u001b[113GKV\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcache,\u001b[10Gso\u001b[13GI'm\u001b[17Gre-benchmarking\u001b[33Gattention\u001b[43Gwith\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gcache\u001b[58Gflushed\u001b[66Gbetween\u001b[74Glayers.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u23fa\u001b[39m Cold-cache decode attention benchmark\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m"]
