[460.92, "\u001b[H\u001b[2G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m The full check passes,\u001b[26Gand\u001b[30GENCODE\u001b[37Gis\u001b[40Gstill\u001b[46Gidentical\u001b[56Gto\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Greference\u001b[73Galgorithm\u001b[83Gon\u001b[86Gall\u001b[90G514\u001b[94Gtexts.\u001b[101GNext\u001b[106Gis\u001b[109GA/B\u001b[113Gtiming\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B of v2 again\u001b[16G the new\u001b[25Gbuild:\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Load dropped about 8 ms (103 \u2192 95.5 ms) wh\u001b[46Gle\u001b[49GGenerate, LOGITS an\u001b[69G FIXED stayed the same,\u001b[93Gso\u001b[96GSwiGLU tiling doesn't\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B matter at fixture sizes. Load is still mostly transposition, so I'm splitting its cost into \u001b[97Ganspose work, source\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B faults and destination fau\u001b[30Gts next.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m The load-time estimate for the 98 MB classifier\u001b[51Gcomes\u001b[57Gto\u001b[60Gabout\u001b[66G95\u001b[69Gms,\u001b[73Gwith\u001b[78Groughly\u001b[86G45\u001b[89Gms\u001b[92Gof\u001b[95Gtransposing\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111G35\u001b[114Gms\u001b[117Gof\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B page faults,"]
