[607.077, "\u001b[H\u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m30\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m \u001b[14G            \u001b[27G     \u001b[33G        \u001b[42G  \u001b[45G            \u001b[58G              \u001b[73G            \u001b[86G   \u001b[90G    \u001b[95G     \u001b[101G   \u001b[105G     \u001b[111G   \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m131\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m   \u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m--             \u001b[29G     \u001b[35G \u001b[37G        \u001b[46G   \u001b[50G     \u001b[56G \u001b[58G        \u001b[67G  \u001b[70G         \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m32\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m \u001b[14G               \u001b[30G         \u001b[40G       \u001b[48G   \u001b[52G  \u001b[55G          \u001b[66G     \u001b[72G    \u001b[77G   \u001b[81G          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 133 \u001b[22m ## Round 2: profiling and optimisation\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 134 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 135 \u001b[22m ### Development workloads used\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThis roun"]
[607.079, "d gained only 9 ms of startup (load to READY went from 104.5 to 95.3 ms). Everything else is unchanged\u001b[115Gwithin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnoise, because the program is now at this M1's hardware and Accelerate limits. The final build passes both \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mcheck.py\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mruns (largest logit error 2.6e-5) and all my other tests.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat profiling showed\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mGeneration is at the memory-bandwidth ceiling.\u001b[22m Reading weights is about 96% of decode time, and the best step\u001b[115Gis\u001b[118G7.3\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bms per token. Reading 438 MB at the measured 59\u201363 GB/s limit takes 7.4 ms, so there's nothing meaningful left\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bwithout reading fewer bytes, which the rules forbid.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPrompt processing is at Accelerate's limit for these shapes.\u001b[22m The matrix products run at about 700 GFLOP/s, which\u001b[118Gis\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe fastest \u001b[38;2;87;105;247msgemm\u001b[39m gets for this layout. Accelerate's other matrix-multiply API (\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mBNNSMatMul\u001b[39m) gives identical "]
[607.081, "results\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band is 5\u201310% slower.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mLoad is mostly unavoidable.\u001b[22m About 45 ms is the transpose itself and about 35 ms is page faults. This system doesn't\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Ballow large memory pages, and Accelerate has no faster transpose.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAttention on short contexts\u001b[22m costs 0.1\u20130.4 ms per token, because the KV cache is pushed out of the CPU cache before\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Beach layer reads it. I re-tested other cache layouts\u001b[58Gwith\u001b[63Gthat\u001b[68Geviction\u001b[77Gsimulated:\u001b[88Gnone\u001b[93Ghelps\u001b[99Gat\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Gfixture\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Blengths,\u001b[14Gand\u001b[18Gthe\u001b[22Gcurrent\u001b[30Gswitch\u001b[37Gto\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gall-heads\u001b[54Gpath\u001b[59Gat\u001b[62G160\u001b[66Gpositions\u001b[76Gis\u001b[79Gstill\u001b[85Gright.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe machine is under heavy memory pressure.\u001b[49G\u001b[22mIt\u001b[52Ghas\u001b[56Gabout\u001b[62G160\u2013300\u001b[70GMB\u001b[73Gfree\u001b[78Gand\u001b[82Gabout\u001b[88G3.2\u001b[92GGB\u001b[95Gin\u001b[98Gcompressed\u001b[109Gmemory.\u001b[117GOnce\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bmodel.bin\u001b[15Gwas\u001b[19Gpushed\u001b[26Gout\u001b[30Gof\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gfile\u001b[42Gcache\u001b[48Gand\u001b[52Gload\u001b[57Gtook\u001b[62G0.9\u001b[66Gs,\u001b[69"]
[607.082, "Gand\u001b[73Grun-to-run\u001b[84Gspeed\u001b[90Gdrifts\u001b[97Gabout\u001b[103G\u00b110%,\u001b[109Gso\u001b[112Gevery\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  compar\u001b[12Gson used alternating runs and m\u001b[44Gdians.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mChanges this round\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mcb2.c\u001b[39m)\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mLazy KV cache:\u001b[21G\u001b[22mmemory\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gsystem\u001b[39Gzero-fills\u001b[50Gon\u001b[53Gfirst\u001b[59Gwrite,\u001b[66Ginstead\u001b[74Gof\u001b[77Gzeroing\u001b[85G75\u001b[88GMB\u001b[91Gat\u001b[94Gload.\u001b[100GIt\u001b[103Gsaves\u001b[109Gload\u001b[114Gtime\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   and 75 MB of memory until long contexts\u001b[46Gfill\u001b[51Git.\u001b[55GPeak\u001b[60Gmemory\u001b[67Gstays\u001b[73Gat\u001b[76G882\u001b[80GMB,\u001b[84Gbecause\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Gpeak\u001b[101Gcomes\u001b[107Gduring\u001b[114Gload.\r\u001b[1B  2.\u001b[K\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H"]
[607.202, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[34B\u001b[1mFaster tokenizer load:\u001b[29G\u001b[22mone\u001b[33Gread\u001b[38Gof\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Gfile\u001b[50Ginto\u001b[55Ga\u001b[57Gsingle\u001b[64Gstring\u001b[71Gbuffer,\u001b[79Ginstead\u001b[87Gof\u001b[90Gabout\u001b[96G96k\u001b[100Gsmall\u001b[106Greads\u001b[112Gand\u001b[116G32k\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H"]
